roportion of net\nsales.\nAs of September 27, 2025 and September 28, 2024, the Company had total""}, {""citation_id"": ""SEC-5"", ""passage_rank"": 5, ""document_id"": ""AAPL_10-K_000032019325000079"", ""ticker"": ""AAPL"", ""form_type"": ""10-K"", ""filing_date"": ""2025-10-31"", ""report_date"": ""2025-09-27"", ""accession_number"": ""0000320193-25-000079"", ""source_url"": ""https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm"", ""line_start"": 1764.0, ""line_end"": 1786.0, ""excerpt"": ""Greater China\nGreater China net sales decreased during 2025 compared to 2024 primarily due to\nlower net sales of iPhone, partially offset by higher net sales of Mac.\n\nJapan\nJapan net sales increased during 2025 compared to 2024 primarily due to higher\nnet sales of iPhone, Services and iPad.\n\nRest of Asia Pacific\nRest of Asia Pacific net sales increased during 2025 compared to 2024 primarily\ndue to higher net sales of iPhone, Services and Mac.\nApple Inc. | 2025 Form 10-K | 22\n\n-------------------""}]",5,"{""answerable"": true, ""attempts"": 1, ""cache_status"": ""live"", ""citation_count"": 5, ""error_type"": null, ""message"": ""Use only the returned evidence and preserve its source metadata."", ""passage_count"": 5, ""status"": ""ok""}","[{""citation_count"": 5, ""retrieval_answerable"": true, ""retrieval_status"": ""ok"", ""retrieved_passage_count"": 5, ""specialist"": ""market_research"", ""status"": ""ok"", ""summary"": ""Combined historical SEC fundamentals with filing retrieval status.""}]","[{""data"": {""accession_number"": ""0000320193-25-000079"", ""annual"": {""capital_expenditures_millions"": 12715.0, ""diluted_eps"": 7.46, ""fiscal_year"": 2025, ""free_cash_flow_millions"": 98767.0, ""operating_cash_flow_millions"": 111482.0, ""revenue_millions"": 416161.0, ""share_repurchases_millions"": 90711.0}, ""as_of"": ""2025-09-27"", ""cache_status"": ""fresh_cache"", ""cik"": ""0000320193"", ""company"": ""Apple Inc."", ""notes""